; Binds `(kaboom n)` to `:impl "wasm:fail"` — the sibling double.wasm
; exports `fail` as a function that returns an `ok=0` structured-error
; frame with code `domain` + a deterministic detail string. Hosts
; surface this as `plugin_func_failed` at the call span.
(plugin :name double :version "1.0.0"
  (expr-func :name kaboom
    :arity (fixed 1)
    :params [number]
    :result number
    :impl "wasm:fail"))
